{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","辛巴达"],["/names/en","Sinbad"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名敏捷的游侠，在战斗中擅长分析敌方情报并进行针对性打击。"],["/description_i18n/en","An agile Rogue adept at assessing the battlefield and countering the enemy."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让我来陪他们玩玩。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let me join the fray."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哈，感谢信任。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Ha, you've put your faith in me."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嗯？到我了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","It's my turn to shine!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失算了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","I misjudged this fight..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","不赖嘛。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Not bad at all."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","嘿，朋友，久等了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Ahoy, friend, did you wait long?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","方向是……确定了，走吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Which direction...? Ah, I know. Let's go."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有动静？嗯……危险解除！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I heard something... Nevermind, there's no danger."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","呦，好宝贝。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/en","You never let me down."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错的宝贝，我喜欢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Now this is a real treasure. I'll cherish this gift."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","行，那我就不客气了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Why not? I'll take it."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","海港百事通"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Seaside Savant"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","别学他，他了解一切，却拒绝面对内心真实的渴望。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Don't be like him. He knows everything, yet refuses to face his true desires."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","不羁船长"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Ocean's Outlaw"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","他曾梦想追逐父辈，握紧舵轮；如今，他的梦想实现了。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","He once dreamt of steering his ancestors' path, hands firm on the ship's wheel—now, that dream is his reality."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“流金之地”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Complete Story Quest - Land of Riches"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/skins/1/provenance/localization/RequireDes/languages/en",{"source":"luae_map","source_file":"luae_translation_map_en.csv","pair_order":"26217"}],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","多交个朋友总没坏处"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Hey, making new friends never hurt anyone, right?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","过来喝一杯吧，思考太多，人会疯的"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Have a drink! Overthinking things will just drive you nuts."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","什么都好，别给我腌鱼"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Anything's fine, just keep the pickled fish away from me."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇噢，这里变漂亮了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This place looks absolutely gorgeous!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚来大吃大喝吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's feast tonight. Bring out the food!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","金币灯笼！有品位！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Gold lanterns, how fancy!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚一起去冒险吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's go on an adventure tonight!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","作为锈锚港的百事通，辛巴达的日常就是见人说人话，见鬼说鬼话，他太了解如何运用语言来达到目的。言语可以是利器，也能是救命的良药。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Sinbad is well known in Rustport as a fast-talking jack-of-all-trades. He knows all too well that words can be used as weapons, but they can also save someone's life."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达原本是不认字的，但他有幸遇到了一个吟游诗人，他教他认字，学费仅需要辛巴达给他当锈锚港的导游，提供锈锚港的风土人情信息。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Originally illiterate, Sinbad was lucky enough to encounter a minstrel who taught him to read. The minstrel merely asked that he serve as his tour guide in Rustport and tell him about the local customs of the people who live there."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达的父亲是个有很多冒险故事的老船长，他在辛巴达心中种下了远航和冒险的种子。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Sinbad's father was an old sea captain with many adventures to tell. He was the person who planted the seeds of adventure in Sinbad's mind."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达的母亲早亡，父亲出海遇难，他在父亲船员的遗孀们抚养下长大，对于辛巴达来说，他有许多“妈妈”。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Sinbad's mother died young, and his father was killed at sea. He was raised by the widows of his father's old crew. For Sinbad, he had many foster mothers growing up."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","小时候的辛巴达曾经在父亲的船舱里睡着，等到父亲在船舱里发现他时，他已经和外邦的旅客成为忘年交。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","As a child, Sinbad once snuck onto his father's ship and fell asleep in one of the cabins. By the time his father discovered him, he had become friends with all the foreign travelers in the sleeping quarters."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达做过水手，绘制过锈锚港海域的地图，给远洋的船只供过货，甚至叫得出每个在码头讨生活的人名字，也熟悉他们擅长的工作。这都是因为，他一直在为心中深藏的远航梦做准备。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Sinbad is experienced in sailing, making maps, and procuring supplies for needy ships. He can even name any sailor who made a living at the docks. Why? Because, deep in his heart, he wants to go on a voyage of his dreams."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","有人骂他见财忘义，有人说他做的是肮脏的口舌生意，面对谩骂，辛巴达不仅耸耸肩照单全收，还会趁机宣传一下自己的情报生意。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","\"He's only in it for the money. He's going to backstab you and sell you out,\" people would whisper. Sinbad just shrugged his shoulders. This is just another chance for him to advertise his skills in intelligence gathering."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达成为海港百事通的契机是他发现光靠打渔种地，无法养活一个村子的人。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","At an early age, Sinbad realized that he couldn't feed his village with fishing and farming alone. That's the reason why he started taking on more unscrupulous jobs at the docks."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达对金钱财宝的追求很坦荡，他常说自己缺钱，却还是会偶尔把金币悄悄放进贫民窟的乞儿碗里。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Sinbad is very open about his desire for gold and treasure. However, even when he was short of coin, he would still occasionally sneak some silver to beggars when no one was looking."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","辛巴达有一枚幸运硬币，那是在他老爹的旧钱包里发现的，遇事不决时，他会把决定权交给这枚硬币。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Sinbad has a lucky coin that was found in his father's old wallet. When he's unsure of a decision, he will flip the coin and see how it lands."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","好潮湿啊，不愧是海边……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","It's so damp here, but we are by the sea after all..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","嗯，说真的，你们来得不是时候。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Well, to be honest, your timing couldn't have been worse."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","和水有关的魔法……唔，好奇怪，我明明记得这本笔记上有记录的呀……"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Water magic... hmm, that's odd. I remember there being a note about it in this book..."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","自从锈锚港封锁后……我就会定期来海边逛逛。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Since Rustport got blockaded, I've been coming to the shore almost every day."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","你这小子，真不打算来百炼工坊干活？我正缺个助手！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Would you really turn down a job at the workshop? I could use an assistant!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411070.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411070.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","呼金 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Hugin & Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，仓鼠小骑士，你还好吧？怎么一脸马上要昏过去的样子？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Hey, little hamster knight, are you alright? Why do you look like you're about to pass out?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411090.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411090.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，你在写什么呢？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Hammie, what are you writing?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411100.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411100.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Hammie & Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","有句话怎么说的来着？“欲言又止时，就像吞了只蜥蜴，却留了截蜥蜴尾巴在嘴边……”"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","What's that saying? \"Holding back your words is like swallowing a lizard but leaving its tail hanging out of your mouth...\""],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411110.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411110.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Chippy & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","除了你，村子里应该还有和你年龄相仿的年轻人吧？"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Apart from you, there must be other young people around, yes?"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411130.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411130.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","没有人来过小水村，见到我的妈妈们后不好奇的，想问就问吧！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","No one who's visited Brineville and met my mothers hasn't been curious. Feel free to ask if you want!"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","看不出来呀，你们这两个小家伙，居然能经历那么多冒险。"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","I wouldn't have guessed. You two little ones have had so many adventures."],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411200.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411200.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","我说，你干嘛拿着两片叶子来回看？在找不同？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","I'm wondering, why are you examining those two leaves so closely? Are you trying to find differences?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411230.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411230.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫 & 路过的荧荧花"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie & Glimmerbloom"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","I've been out to sea before, but this time just hits differently!"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411240.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411240.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","你们知道，我不是个诚实的人……"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Actually, I haven't been honest..."],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411420.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411420.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","一个人喝酒，这可不像你，索尼娅。"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","Drinking alone? How like you, Sonja."],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415038.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415038.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","多交个朋友总没坏处"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","Hey, making new friends never hurt anyone, right?"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415320.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415320.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","什么都好，别给我腌鱼"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","Anything's fine, just keep the pickled fish away from me."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415321.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415321.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","哇噢，这里变漂亮了！"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","This place looks absolutely gorgeous!"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415375.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415375.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","今晚来大吃大喝吧！"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","Let's feast tonight. Bring out the food!"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415376.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415376.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","金币灯笼！有品位！"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/en","Gold lanterns, how fancy!"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415545.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415545.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","今晚一起去冒险吧！"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/en","Let's go on an adventure tonight!"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415546.json"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415546.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/en","Sinbad"]]}